sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Monster phone (iOS)
    participant V as Villager phones (iOS)
    participant S as Game server
    participant W as Host screen (web)
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over M,W: Night (30s)
    S->>W: phase:start night, endsAt
    S->>M: phase:start night
    S->>V: phase:start night
    M->>S: night:submit victimIds (two if Werewolf power)
    V->>S: night:submit suspectId
    Note over V,W: timer ends: apply candles, resolve the kill

    Note over M,W: Morning (10s)
    S->>W: morning:reveal deadIds or none
    S->>M: morning:reveal
    S->>V: morning:reveal (dead players see Out)
    Note over S,W: win check

    Note over M,W: Day actions (30s)
    S->>W: phase:start day, endsAt
    S->>V: phase:start day
    S->>M: phase:start day (flavor message + power button)
    V->>S: day:submit search / commune / candle
    opt Vampire or Witch power unused
        M->>S: power:use targetId
    end
    Note over V,W: timer ends: apply caps and Monster powers
    S->>V: you:result (clue, nothing found, or candle blocked)

    Note over M,W: Discussion (60s), then vote (30s)
    S->>W: phase:start discussion, endsAt
    S->>M: phase:start discussion
    S->>V: phase:start discussion
    S->>W: phase:start vote, endsAt
    S->>M: phase:start vote
    S->>V: phase:start vote
    M->>S: vote:submit targetId or skip
    V->>S: vote:submit targetId or skip
    Note over V,W: timer ends: missed votes count as Skip
    S->>W: vote:reveal votes, banishedId?
    S->>M: vote:reveal
    S->>V: vote:reveal
    Note over S,W: win check

    alt Monster banished or one Villager left
        S->>W: game:over winner, monster type, hunches
        S->>M: game:over
        S->>V: game:over
        S->>DB: save game, players, stats
    else no winner
        S->>W: phase:start night (next round)
    end
